- [Text to Speech Solutions for Learners (Students & Adults)](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/education/): Whether learning at primary school, high school, university or in the workplace, ReadSpeaker's text to speech solution helps make content inclusive, engaging, and accessible.
- [ReadSpeaker speechCloud API - Enterprise Text-to-Speech REST API](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechcloud-api/): Text-to-speech REST API: 90 languages, 300 voices, SSML, custom dictionaries, six audio formats. Real-time or batch. ISO/IEC 27001 certified.
- [Embedded Text-to-Speech SDK - On-Device AI Voices](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechengine-sdk-embedded/): Add natural AI voices to any device with ReadSpeaker speechEngine SDK Embedded. On-device text-to-speech for ARM, iOS, Android, and Embedded Linux hardware.
- [speechEngine SDK - On-Device TTS for Desktop Apps](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechengine-sdk/): On-device text-to-speech SDK for desktop and PC apps. 150+ AI voices, 50+ languages. C/C++ and Java on Windows/Linux, C# on Windows. Runs offline, no network calls.
- [speechMaker Studio: Collaborative Text to Speech for Teams](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechmaker-studio/): Create, edit, and manage professional voice content with ReadSpeaker speechMaker Studio, a browser-based, collaborative text-to-speech platform for teams.
- [Create Audio From Text - ReadSpeaker speechMaker](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechmaker/): Convert text into downloadable audio files. Produce single files or batches from Excel in MP3, OGG, and WAV. Cloud-based and ISO 27001 certified.
- [ReadSpeaker speechServer MRCP: MRCP server for IVR TTS](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechserver-mrcp/): On-premise MRCP server for IVR systems and call centers. IETF MRCPv2 + UniMRCP interoperability. Certified Cisco CVP, Avaya AAEP. 150+ voices, 50+ languages.
- [ReadSpeaker speechServer - On-premise text-to-speech server](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/speechserver/): Self-hosted, network-based text-to-speech server you run on your own Windows Server or Linux. Integrate over TCP/IP, command line, REST, or C, Java, .NET SDKs.
- [ReadSpeaker TextAid - Literacy Support Software for Every Learner](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/textaid/): Help every student read, write, and study with confidence. WCAG 2.2 AA, exam-ready, LMS-integrated. Free trial, no credit card.
- [webReader: Text to Speech for Any Website](https://www.readspeaker.com/products/webreader/): Add a Listen button to your website. webReader reads any page aloud in 50+ languages with real-time highlighting, WCAG 2.2 AA compliant, no rebuild required.

